## /packs/:id/contributors
### <span class="bdg bdg-success">GET</span>

Get a list of contributors to a pack


#### URL Parameters
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

**id**:
The pack's UID or plaintext id. Using UID is more performant as it is a direct lookup.




#### Possible Responses
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">OK - 200</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">NOT_FOUND - 404</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>



#### Examples
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

!!! note "Set a packs's data"
    ```ts
    fetch('https://api.smithed.dev/v2/packs/coc/contributors')
    ```

<br/>


### <span class="bdg bdg-success">POST</span>

Add a list of contributors to a pack


#### URL Parameters
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

**id**:
The pack's UID or plaintext id. Using UID is more performant as it is a direct lookup.


#### Query Parameters
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

<span class="bdg bdg-dark">token</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string</label>
Either Firebase Id Token or a valid PAT

<span class="bdg bdg-dark">contributors</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string[]</label>




#### Possible Responses
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">OK - 200</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">NOT_FOUND - 404</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">UNAUTHORIZED - 401</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">FORBIDDEN - 403</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>



#### Examples
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

!!! note "Set a packs's data"
    ```ts
    fetch('https://api.smithed.dev/v2/packs/coc/contributors?token=NOT_TODAY_HAHA&contributors=CreeperMagnet_', {
      method:'POST'
    })
    ```

<br/>


### <span class="bdg bdg-success">DELETE</span>

Remove a list of contributors from a pack


#### URL Parameters
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

**id**:
The pack's UID or plaintext id. Using UID is more performant as it is a direct lookup.


#### Query Parameters
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

<span class="bdg bdg-dark">token</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string</label>
Either Firebase Id Token or a valid PAT

<span class="bdg bdg-dark">contributors</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string[]</label>




#### Possible Responses
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">OK - 200</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">string</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">NOT_FOUND - 404</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">UNAUTHORIZED - 401</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>

<span class="bdg bdg-primary">FORBIDDEN - 403</span> <label class="sd-text-secondary">ApiError</label>



#### Examples
<div class='sd-bg-secondary' style='width: 95%; height: 1px; margin: 0em 0em 0.1em 0em'></div>

!!! note "Set a packs's data"
    ```ts
    fetch('https://api.smithed.dev/v2/packs/coc/contributors?token=NOT_TODAY_HAHA&contributors=CreeperMagnet_', {
      method:'DELETE'
    })
    ```

